    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3530" root="بور" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوَارٌ</span></b> , an inf. n. of 1: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بُورٌ</span>, last sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوَارِ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>, [an indecl. noun,] <i>Perdition:</i> (El-Ahmar, S, M, K:) as in the saying,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَزَلَتْ بَوَار عَلَى الكُفَّار</span> <i>Perdition fell upon the unbelievers.</i> (El-Ahmar, S, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْرٌ</span>.

